            "tab_content": "<p>Bacca Bucci offers a warranty on its products against manufacturing defects. The warranty period and terms may vary depending on the specific product purchased. <strong>Typically, the warranty period for Bacca Bucci shoes is one month from the date of purchase.</strong></p><p>During the warranty period, we will repair or replace the defective product at no charge, provided that the defect is not a result of normal wear and tear, misuse, or abuse of the product. The warranty does not cover accidental damage or damage caused by improper use or care of the product.</p><p>To claim warranty service, customers need to email us the order number and image of the defective product at <strong>crm@baccabucci.com</strong>. Upon receiving the package, our customer care executive will inspect the product and determine whether it is covered under warranty. If the defect is covered under warranty, we will provide a repair or replacement according to the terms of the warranty.</p>"
